<title>FINLAND: Finnish prelim April trade surplus FIM 4.0 bln-NCB.</title>
<headline>Finnish prelim April trade surplus FIM 4.0 bln-NCB.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's trade surplus rose to 4.0 billion markka in April from 3.5 billion in March and from 3.8 billion in April last year, the National Customs Board (NCB) said in statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said the figures were preliminary.</p>
<p>The value of exports rose 14 percent year-on-year in April and the value of imports rose 17 percent, NCB said.  </p>
<p>Trade balance (million markka):</p>
<p>		  Apr '97    Mar '97    Apr '96</p>
<p> Exports	 18,000     16,043     15,759</p>
<p> Imports	 14,000     12,575     11,987</p>
<p> Balance	 +4,000     +3,468     +3,772</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
